OL,3,GNEWSARare footage and photos bring
OL,4,Acity's past to life
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn exhibition showing visual records of
OL,7,Fa city's past and present will bring
OL,8,Ftogether three collections for the
OL,9,Ffirst time.
OL,11,FCoventry Then & Now will feature
OL,12,Farchive photographs of the city, rare
OL,13,Ffilm footage of the construction of
OL,14,FCoventry Cathedral and contemporary
OL,15,Fimages.
OL,17,FThe exhibition, which opens on 11
OL,18,FSeptember, tells the story of more than
OL,19,F70 years of history.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
