OL,3,GNEWSARare footage and photos bring
OL,4,Acity's past to life
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlan Denyer, head of LTB Showrooms, the
OL,7,Fvolunteer-run community arts venue
OL,8,Fwhere the exhibition will be held,
OL,9,Fsaid: "When you walk round Coventry,
OL,10,Fyou think you have seen it all, but a
OL,11,Fgood photograph can see a new image, a
OL,12,Fnew angle, and there is some really
OL,13,Fgreat stuff."
